New-Item -Name ".gitignore" -ItemType "file"
```

Luego ábrelo en tu editor y pega esto:
```
# Dependencies
node_modules/
**/node_modules/

# Environment variables
.env
**/.env

# Build outputs
dist/
**/dist/
coverage/
**/coverage/

# Uploads
backend/uploads/

# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Angular cache
.angular/

# IDE
.vscode/
.idea/